        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the logic for updating the `dp` array. The current approach updates the `dp` array based on the last element of the subarray, which might not account for the correct contribution of each flower across multiple subarrays. Instead, use a prefix sum approach to accumulate the contributions of each flower across all subarrays it belongs to. This ensures that each flower's mood is multiplied by the number of subarrays it is part of.",
